<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for June 26/27. Estonian kroon is</p>
<p>pegged to German mark at 8:1.</p>
<p>		   June 26     June 25</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.43261	0.43337</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.09993	2.10025</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.68185	2.67005</p>
<p>    GBP	23.02102     22.90302</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.07429	0.07433</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.45155	3.44306</p>
<p>    LVL	24.23812     24.18337</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.00239	0.00239</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.79477	1.7887</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.42963	7.42053</p>
<p>    USD	13.8024	13.7688</p>
<p>    XEU	15.68712     15.67371</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201/2, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
